* **MapLibre GL JS style spec – sky layer**: <https://maplibre.org/maplibre-gl-js-docs/api/style-spec/layers/#sky>
* **Fog (atmospheric) property**: <https://maplibre.org/maplibre-gl-js-docs/api/map/#mapsetfog>
* **Examples** (official repo): `examples/sky.html` and `examples/fog.html`.

